sequenceDiagram
    participant Recruiter
    participant Chat as Industry chatbot
    participant Jobs as Job corpus
    participant CVs as CV corpus
    participant Index as Vespa / ES index
    participant Rank as Ranking layer
    participant Pref as Preference updater

    Recruiter->>Chat: Draft / complete job post
    Chat->>Jobs: Structured job fields
    CVs->>Index: Embed + sparse vectors
    Jobs->>Index: Embed + sparse vectors
    Recruiter->>Rank: Search / shortlist request
    Rank->>Index: Hybrid retrieval
    Index-->>Rank: Candidate set
    Rank-->>Recruiter: Ranked matches
    Recruiter->>Pref: Actions (open / save / reject)
    Pref->>Rank: Updated preference vector
